WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:03.453
(piano music)

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.727
(clock ticking)

00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:13.853
- I've been noticing, um, Ali?

00:00:13.853 --> 00:00:14.686
Hey Ali?

00:00:14.686 --> 00:00:15.519
- Ali!

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.644
Ali!

00:00:17.644 --> 00:00:19.467
- Sorry, I'm so out of it today.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.034
- They said they were gonna keep me at

00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:21.998
the top of the list, so that's good.

00:00:21.998 --> 00:00:23.147
- Ali if you don't mind staying for

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:24.842
another couple of hours,
just to make sure.

00:00:24.842 --> 00:00:29.179
- [Man] If anything goes
wrong then it's on us

00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:31.169
and then we look bad...

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:32.043
(horn honking)

00:00:32.043 --> 00:00:34.934
(tires screeching)

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.354
- [Doctor] Well, one thing
we look for in insomniacs

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:40.059
is people who get anxious
about the idea of sleeping

00:00:40.059 --> 00:00:43.356
itself and that contributes
to keeping you awake.

00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:44.459
Is there anything in
particular you're feeling

00:00:44.459 --> 00:00:45.515
anxious about?

00:00:45.515 --> 00:00:46.938
- Like, why are you even stressed?

00:00:46.938 --> 00:00:48.331
Don't make such a big deal.

00:00:48.331 --> 00:00:49.740
- [Man On Phone] I told you
about this two weeks ago.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.588
- I'm sorry, I just...

00:00:50.588 --> 00:00:51.483
- [Man On Phone] You don't wanna go?

00:00:51.483 --> 00:00:52.316
- No it's not...

00:00:52.316 --> 00:00:54.171
- I'm actually kind of tired.

00:00:54.171 --> 00:00:55.852
- Oh, okay.

00:00:55.852 --> 00:00:57.500
- [Doctor] I'd recommend trying not to put

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:00.088
too much pressure on yourself,
especially falling asleep.

00:01:00.088 --> 00:01:03.082
- I just feel like I need
a night off, you know?

00:01:03.082 --> 00:01:04.666
You guys have fun though, okay?

00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:05.736
- Okay.

00:01:05.736 --> 00:01:06.839
- You said yesterday you wanna start

00:01:06.839 --> 00:01:07.849
working out again.

00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:09.177
- I lied.

00:01:09.177 --> 00:01:10.010
- Okay.

00:01:11.498 --> 00:01:13.178
- Ali, I already told you I'm completely

00:01:13.178 --> 00:01:14.937
for you to answer right now.

00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:16.729
- I know but this just
sounds like a really

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:17.562
good opportunity.

00:01:17.562 --> 00:01:18.395
- For you.

00:01:18.395 --> 00:01:19.639
- You know you're not
supposed to drink coffee

00:01:19.639 --> 00:01:21.160
if you're having sleep problems.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.656
- [Man] Now this will help you sleep.

00:01:23.656 --> 00:01:25.465
You really need to take
some sleeping pills

00:01:25.465 --> 00:01:26.441
or something.

00:01:26.441 --> 00:01:28.921
- Thank you so much.

00:01:28.921 --> 00:01:29.754
- Thanks.

00:01:32.878 --> 00:01:36.006
- [Man] Hey, mind if I join you?

00:01:36.006 --> 00:01:38.089
- Sorry I'm running late.

00:01:39.447 --> 00:01:42.421
- It took me almost 20 minutes last night

00:01:42.421 --> 00:01:43.254
to fall asleep.

00:01:43.254 --> 00:01:44.900
I was just tossing and turning.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.455
- Jenn said she didn't get your email.

00:01:46.455 --> 00:01:47.912
- No I didn't send the email.

00:01:47.912 --> 00:01:50.310
- Okay, why did you tell
me that you emailed her?

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.672
- You bringing it up over and over,

00:01:51.672 --> 00:01:53.517
I keep telling you I am perfectly happy

00:01:53.517 --> 00:01:54.654
with my career right now.

00:01:54.654 --> 00:01:55.487
- So you lied to me?

00:01:55.487 --> 00:01:56.446
I would have stopped bringing it up if

00:01:56.446 --> 00:01:58.109
you had told me the truth
about what you wanted.

00:01:58.109 --> 00:01:59.407
- Okay but I don't need anything from you.

00:01:59.407 --> 00:02:02.407
- Fine. I guess I'll pay for dinner.

00:02:07.246 --> 00:02:09.005
- What was that?

00:02:09.005 --> 00:02:09.980
Are you that unhappy,

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:10.813
is this that bad

00:02:10.813 --> 00:02:12.174
for you to be here?
- I don't know.

00:02:12.174 --> 00:02:13.007
I know I'm not happy right now.

00:02:13.007 --> 00:02:13.983
- You haven't been feeling good.

00:02:13.983 --> 00:02:14.816
You haven't been sleeping.

00:02:14.816 --> 00:02:15.918
You're kinda bitchy and
shitty because of that,

00:02:15.918 --> 00:02:17.054
and I don't know how to react when you

00:02:17.054 --> 00:02:18.351
don't let me in, so what am I supposed to

00:02:18.351 --> 00:02:19.262
do with that?

00:02:19.262 --> 00:02:20.301
- I don't know, it's been like that

00:02:20.301 --> 00:02:21.134
for a long time.

00:02:21.134 --> 00:02:21.967
And I don't know if it's just a thing

00:02:21.967 --> 00:02:22.894
we're working through, or if we're

00:02:22.894 --> 00:02:24.718
just drifting apart.

00:02:24.718 --> 00:02:27.385
- What are you saying right now?

00:02:30.814 --> 00:02:31.903
- [Girl] I don't know,
I mean I think maybe

00:02:31.903 --> 00:02:33.486
we should break up.

00:02:38.111 --> 00:02:38.944
- Okay.

00:02:42.863 --> 00:02:43.696
Alright...

00:02:45.107 --> 00:02:46.107
I'm gonna...

00:02:46.988 --> 00:02:48.071
I'm gonna go.

00:03:10.753 --> 00:03:12.920
(puffing)

00:03:21.686 --> 00:03:24.269
(soft snoring)

